.TH RETA\-EXTRACT\-HTML\-CLASSES\-NATIVE 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
reta\-extract\-html\-classes\-native \- native extractor for generated HTML class names
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B reta\-extract\-html\-classes\-native
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B reta\-extract\-html\-classes\-native
extracts HTML class names from generated Reta HTML output for documentation, checks, and release verification.

.SH NOTES
This command is installed because it is a build or diagnostic target of the native Mojo port. Normal users usually start with .BR reta (1), .BR rp (1), .BR rpl (1), .BR rpe (1), or .BR rpb (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1), generate_html(1)
